OL,3,GNEWSACoroner's safety plea after death
OL,4,Aof man at lake
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner urged people to "heed safety
OL,7,Fpleas" on open water swimming after the
OL,8,Fdeath of a man in Nottinghamshire was
OL,9,Fruled accidental.
OL,11,FPanashe Muchenje, 19, had gone swimming
OL,12,Fafter travelling to Balderton Lake, off
OL,13,FHeron Way in New Balderton, with two
OL,14,Ffriends on 28 May, an inquest at
OL,15,FNottingham Coroner's Court heard.
OL,17,FHe disappeared under the water and
OL,18,Fdespite the prompt response of
OL,19,Femergency services, died two days later
OL,20,Fafter his life support was switched
OL,21,Foff.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
