OL,3,GNEWSACoroner's safety plea after death
OL,4,Aof man at lake
OL,5,
OL,6,FRuling the death accidental, senior
OL,7,Fcoroner Mairin Casey described Muchenje
OL,8,Fas a successful student with
OL,9,F"everything to live for", but said he
OL,10,Fhad underestimated the risks of going
OL,11,Finto the "dangerous" lake.
